hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2714","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Abu 'Asim, who said: Ja'far bin 'Abdullah narrated to me, saying: I saw Muhammad bin 'Abbad bin Ja'far kiss the Black Stone and prostrate upon it. Then he said: I saw your maternal uncle, Ibn 'Abbas, kiss it and prostrate upon it. Ibn 'Abbas said: I saw 'Umar bin Al-Khattab kiss it and prostrate upon it. Then he said: \I saw"""
